Night-rested happily risen Rama asked victory Vibhishana folded offers baths unguents clothes ornaments sandal garlands and skilled lotus-eyed women --- Rama replies invite Sugriva-led monkeys to bath instead --- Rama says delicate true-promised Bharata suffers for him without whom bath clothes are not dear --- Rama says by this hard road let us go swiftly to city Ayodhya --- Vibhishana promises conveyance in a day by sunlike Pushpaka of brother Kubera seized by Ravana standing cloudlike to bear to Ayodhya --- Vibhishana begs if favoured remembering virtues if friendship stay with Lakshmana and wife worshipped with all desires then go accepting offered honour --- Vibhishana propitiates as servant affectionately respectfully friendly not commanding --- Rama before all says honoured by counsel effort and best friendship he would do word but mind hastens to brother Bharata who came to Chitrakuta whose head-bowed request was undone --- Rama names Kausalya Sumitra famed Kaikeyi gurus friends and citizens with sons and bids quickly present vimana with task done dwelling not agreeable asking leave without resentment --- Golden-pictured vaidurya-altared turret-girt silver-bright banner-flagged golden-mansion gold-lotus adorned bell-netted pearl-windowed Meru-like Vishvakarman-made mansion presented --- Crystal-floored vaidurya-seated costly-carpeted irresistible mind-swift vimana presented and Vibhishana stood there